OL,3,GNEWSAUS rockets firm could take over
OL,4,Amothballed Highland spaceport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rockets manufacturer says the
OL,7,Fmothballed Sutherland Spaceport could
OL,8,Fbecome its first launch site outside
OL,9,Fthe US.
OL,11,FColorado-based Leap has agreed to work
OL,12,Fwith Highlands and Islands Enterprise
OL,13,F(HIE), which owns the area of peatland
OL,14,Fnear Tongue, to develop the plans.
OL,16,FLittle work has been done at the site
OL,17,Fafter Moray-headquartered rockets firm
OL,18,FOrbex put construction on hold in 2024.
OL,19,FThe company later collapsed and its
OL,20,Fassets were sold off.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
