OL,3,GNEWSAUS rockets firm could take over
OL,4,Amothballed Highland spaceport
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeap said the spaceport could
OL,7,Fpotentially be used for launching small
OL,8,Fsatellites for customers in the UK and
OL,9,Fmainland Europe.
